Z||000004||Mr.Frosty||06-29-2001||03:06 PM||||Well that was just a start.If you want custom and don't want to spend $1200.00 for just a dash,get some plywood,fiberglass and start constructing your own.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"> Or keep looking in the archives for the guy who redid his dash for audio competition.That may be more in line with what you want to do.I've completely removed the interior on a few of mine and you can do some cool stuff if you've got the time and I don't,so I'm looking at the ferrari euro-style dash.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>85 GT Turbo intercooled||||reg||1
